Better Sidebar adapts code from Herdr Desktop's shipped spaces and agents mods.
Its bundled navigation and pull-request SVG icons are also adapted from
Herdr Desktop (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, Apache License 2.0).

Changes made here (2026):
- Renamed to pokemon-sidebar (its settings, icons and shared state under that name).
- Each agent drawn as its Pokémon's card, from Pokémon herd's shared "agent-cards":
  the agent's name large, the card's edge in its status colour, the Pokémon's
  portrait, hearts and how close it is to evolving on one line, a ⚔ mark (with who,
  on hover) when another agent works in the same folder, and a bar on the focused card.
- The collapsed rail: each space's letter with its agents beneath it, each as its
  Pokémon (shared "agent-icons") with a dot in its status colour; their names and
  times on hover.
